            "_id": "chapter-xviii/section-4",
            "title": "Cèpes",
            "introduction": [
                "Those _cèpes_ which are barely opened or not opened at all are not parboiled. Contrariwise, those which are open should be washed, parboiled, and stewed in butter, after having been well dried."
            ],
